  "notes": "IM Motors (also known as Zhiji / IM Presented by MG) is confirmed in the Australian market. The brand is a premium EV sub-brand of SAIC, sold through the MG Motor Australia dealer network (110+ dealers). The IM5 sedan and IM6 SUV first entered Australia in mid-2025 (sources cite June or July 2025), with a major formal launch event on 30 July 2026 at Sydney's White Bay Cruise Terminal. Large-scale customer deliveries began in early September 2026. The brand uses the trading name 'IM Presented by MG' in Australia. Pricing has shifted since the June 2025 launch: launch prices were $60,990/$69,990/$80,990 drive-away; thebeep.com.au (as of September 2026) shows $57,990/$64,990/$74,990 drive-away reflecting subsequent price reductions confirmed by EOFY promotions. All prices recorded here are from thebeep.com.au as most current. The official spec sheet (MG_IM6_Specs_v8.pdf) from mgmotor.com.au is used for detailed technical specifications. Neither the IM5 nor IM6 has yet received an ANCAP star rating as of September 2026; testing has been submitted. No IM8 or other IM models confirmed for AU as of this date.",
